==== Year identifiers ====
In order to avoid any confusion, the letters I, O, U and Z have never been issued as year identifiers: I because of its similarity to the numeral 1; O because of similarity to a zero; U because of similarity to the letter V; and Z because of similarity to the numeral 2.<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.autobulbsdirect.co.uk/blog/car-registration-years-chart/|title=Car Registration By Years|website=Autobulbsdirect.co.uk|access-date=28 August 2026}}</ref>

